official_announcement.text:
India successfully test-fired the Medium Range Ballistic Missile (MRBM) Agni-4 from the Integrated Test Range, Chandipur, Odisha on August 06, 2026. The launch, conducted under the aegis of the Strategic Forces Command, successfully validated all operational and technical parameters.

